{"version":1,"content":"<p>Microsoft Learn於11月12日在社交平台X發文詢問「AI初學者應該儘早養成什麼習慣」，但發帖時微軟的Exchange Online已經出現故障，Outlook、Teams、SharePoint、Copilot等多項Microsoft 365服務也受到影響。帖子迅速成為用户的吐槽區，獲得超過120萬次瀏覽和1100多條回復；點讚最高的一條建議是：「確保你的產品不會宕機。」</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586294.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T13:42:11.591058+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":198,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T13:19:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T13:35:28.739535+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T13:35:28.739535+00:00","content_hash":"c7f1bd080e1781b5fe604a77d1e6a4c5a63158a28aeafa82f1957bc0801862be","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}